Shotgun Pellet Analyzer Privacy Policy

Effective Date: July 2026

Shotgun Pellet Analyzer processes all images locally on your device.

Data Collection

Shotgun Pellet Analyzer does not:

* collect personal information
* create user accounts
* upload photographs
* track user activity
* use advertising
* share data with third parties

Photos

The app requests access to your photo library only so you can select images for analysis. Images remain on your device unless you explicitly choose to share or export them.
